md='# Adapter audit at frozen release candidate\n\nFrozen commit `33d8ee47ad733f1198f2b2fb8d171b31c7b10678`, tree `719c0a5255f66b74f9bc58fd969905ee7d7c49d5`. Source inspection covers every registered adapter. Executed probes import only fresh `reports/tmp/release-rc-audit/candidate-a` modules and its own installed dependencies. Current full suite evidence is the parent auditor\'s `../canonical/commands.json` and `tests.log`: 251/251 pass. That total is bounded local test evidence, not exhaustive soundness.\n\nHonest maturity count: **2 STABLE, 9 EXPERIMENTAL, 0 HISTORICAL, 1 INTERFACE_ONLY**. Stored descriptors say 2 STABLE/10 EXPERIMENTAL; Ledger is only refusal/interface behavior. There are 12 registered surfaces, 4 selected native runtime surfaces, 7 original relation/method/admission surfaces, and 1 ledger boundary. Unsupported protocol operations do not execute an upstream capability.\n\n| Adapter | Audited maturity | Actual executed relation | Adversarial/source result and limit |\n|---|---|---|---|\n'
